 Travelers’ abilities and builds come together, powerful combinations and explosive synergies emerge—ones that could never be created alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/3a5e5de0c02e8292539a213b3fb639da.webp?t=1783499966\" width=780 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/f790da434d21d2e0f229703ed30ef5ff.poster.avif?t=1783499966\" width=1000 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/f790da434d21d2e0f229703ed30ef5ff.webm?t=1783499966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/f790da434d21d2e0f229703ed30ef5ff.mp4?t=1783499966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ever-changing choices to alter your attacks, enhance your abilities, and discover unexpected combinations. Even with the same Traveler, the build you create can lead to a completely different combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no single answer.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your strategy from the options offered in each run, and take on challenges that may seem impossible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/0fbde005b3c506fcbc4443c7e936e109.webp?t=1783499966\" width=780 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/ad7e66c4b33435e7b6eed820cf7bd1b2.poster.avif?t=1783499966\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/ad7e66c4b33435e7b6eed820cf7bd1b2.webm?t=1783499966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444750/extras/ad7e66c4b33435e7b6eed820cf7bd1b2.mp4?t=1783499966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dream world is filled with new choices and variables every time you play. Four difficulty levels, distinctive boss encounters, and Lucid Dream modifiers demand different tactics and build decisions with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than follow a familiar path, try new combinations that match each changing situation. The more you play, the more powerful strategies you will discover as you break through the dream world in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dream awaits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Shape of Dreams Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable Travelers with unique combat mechanics and upgrade paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ Memories and Essences to customize builds and transform abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Lucid Dreams to twist difficulty in unique ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ emotes &amp; emblems to personalize your Traveler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 worlds with handcrafted bosses, monsters, and secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Shape of Dreams delivers fast-paced top-down roguelite action with chaotic projectile-filled battles, fluid combat, and high-stakes co-op. Play solo or with up to three friends as you dodge overwhelming attacks and unleash devastating builds.", "supported_languages": "Korean, English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spani